{"seq":2,"slug":"letters-and-essays","title":"Letters And Essays","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/letters-and-essays","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"letters-on-learning","title":"论学书信与《答顾东桥书》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/letters-and-essays/letters-on-learning","wordCount":1364,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-inquiry-on-the-great-learning","title":"《大学问》：王门的教典","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/letters-and-essays/the-inquiry-on-the-great-learning","wordCount":1337,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察王阳明的论学书信与《大学问》。他的论学书信（如《答顾东桥书》），系统而深入地阐述了心学的核心主张，并辨析、回应了各种质疑，理论性较强。《大学问》则是王阳明晚年的&quot;教典&quot;，以独特的诠释阐发了《大学》，集中呈现了&quot;致良知&quot;与&quot;万物一体之仁&quot;的崇高境界。本章揭示王阳明心学的系统阐发与最高境界。</p>\n"}